WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.881
Start with one small, reproducible reading task.

2
00:00:03.881 --> 00:00:09.541
Open the linked CV32A65X package and find the superscalar enable flag.

3
00:00:09.541 --> 00:00:16.009
Follow it into the derived configuration and identify the number of issue ports.

4
00:00:16.009 --> 00:00:19.163
Then check the MMU and privilege flags.

5
00:00:19.163 --> 00:00:27.733
You now have a precise statement about one source snapshot, instead of a vague statement about the family.

6
00:00:27.733 --> 00:00:35.819
Use the project page to continue into architecture, software or verification according to your goal.

7
00:00:35.819 --> 00:00:39.700
That is the foundation for a deeper CVA6 course.

